OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 26 DEC
OL,4,G0100FJonathan Ray
OL,5,     GJonathan Ray keeps you company
OL,6,     Gall through the night with
OL,7,     Gbeautiful music for the early
OL,8,     Ghours, including the Dawn Chorus
OL,9,     Gat 5.15am.
OL,10,G0630FAled Jones
OL,11,     GJoin Aled for an uplifting start
OL,12,     Gto Boxing Day with the greatest
OL,13,     Gseasonal music to accompany you
OL,14,     Gthrough the morning.
OL,15,G0900FThe Classic FM Hall of Fame Hour
OL,16,     GAled Jones brings you an hour of
OL,17,     Gthe biggest classical hits from
OL,18,     Gthe Classic FM Hall of Fame - the
OL,19,     Gannual Top 300 chart voted for by
OL,20,     Gyou.
